title: "electronicspy"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
abstract: "A curated collection of electronics, customer sales, and financial market datasets sourced from Kaggle for data analysis, statistical modeling, and machine learning research. Includes electronics product data, customer purchase behavior and demographics, sales transactions, product types, and historical stock prices for Samsung Electronics, supporting research in product analysis, consumer behavior, sales trends, financial analysis, and stock market forecasting."
